GCCSRCH  EXEC      Establish a disk search order for GCCLIB code

GCCGENM  EXEC      Generate a GCCLIB MACLIB file used in assembling
                   GCC and bREXX ASSEMBLE programs.
GCCASM   EXEC      Assemble a GCCLIB assembler program
GCCCOMP  EXEC      Compile a GCCLIB C program
GCCGEN   EXEC      Generate GCCLIB System disk files

GCCBUILD EXEC      Create the complete GCC runtime executable files

BRXSRCH  EXEC      Establish a disk search order for bREXX code
BRXSRCHD EXEC      Establish a disk search order for a debug version of bREXX
BRXSRCHT EXEC      Establish a disk search order for a test version of bREXX

BRXASM   EXEC      Assemble a bREXX component assembler program
BRXCOMP  EXEC      Compile a bREXX component C program
BRXCOMPD EXEC      Compile a debug version of a bREXX component C program
BRXGEN   EXEC      Generate bREXX System disk files

BRXBUILD EXEC      Create the complete bREXX executable file

TXTDATE  EXEC      Update an object file with its source file timestamps, a la
                   VMFASM.
* The following tool is not shipped with bREXX or GCC, but is on the CMS Y-disk
EXPLOIT  EXEC      Utility program on Y disk for generating system components
